WEBVTT

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:07.411
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:15.241
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.621 --> 00:00:21.061
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:26.221
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.631 --> 00:00:33.121
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:37.101
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:44.071
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:52.181
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:59.421
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.631 --> 00:01:05.661
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:11.631
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:19.051
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.721 --> 00:01:26.991
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:31.961 --> 00:01:34.861
Its face is very friendly, however...

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:08.091
Do you want to revive
the sword at any cost?

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.591
Yes.

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:15.661
Hikaru's Wish and Presea's Secret

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:53.711
Rayearth...

00:03:06.251 --> 00:03:08.191
You're a little feverish.

00:03:09.691 --> 00:03:14.031
I cannot heal illnesses with
my magic. Take care of yourself...

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:19.031
Umi...

00:03:19.371 --> 00:03:20.601
Fuu...

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:37.921
Hey, wait just a minute, Ascot!

00:03:38.591 --> 00:03:40.021
Hold on, Ascot.

00:03:45.591 --> 00:03:47.031
I said wait!

00:03:51.031 --> 00:03:52.001
Lafarga.

00:03:56.371 --> 00:03:58.461
I cannot allow you to go.

00:03:59.911 --> 00:04:01.141
Please move.

00:04:01.811 --> 00:04:04.901
I assume you're going out
to save the Magic Knights.

00:04:08.221 --> 00:04:09.681
I said wait!

00:04:12.551 --> 00:04:16.011
I was saved by the Magic Knights.

00:04:17.691 --> 00:04:20.131
Those three saved my heart...

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:23.461
...which had been lonely for so long.

00:04:24.471 --> 00:04:26.231
It's my turn now.

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:27.791
Ascot...

00:04:28.741 --> 00:04:29.831
I...

00:04:31.541 --> 00:04:32.971
...love Umi.

00:04:34.711 --> 00:04:40.171
If something happened to her,
I would always regret...

00:04:40.751 --> 00:04:42.841
...that I couldn't do anything.

00:04:45.921 --> 00:04:50.321
I hurt a lot of people blindly
following Zagato's every word.

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.991
Not just his enemies,
the Magic Knights...

00:04:54.631 --> 00:04:59.071
If Princess Emeraude hadn't
wished for her revival, I would have...

00:05:00.141 --> 00:05:01.901
...killed Presea too...

00:05:06.471 --> 00:05:08.571
I don't want to regret...

00:05:09.311 --> 00:05:10.571
...anything anymore!

00:05:10.681 --> 00:05:11.701
Ascot!

00:05:32.101 --> 00:05:33.231
Caldina...

00:05:52.551 --> 00:05:53.681
Ascot...

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:33.591
Umi...

00:06:35.001 --> 00:06:36.051
Fuu...

00:06:42.171 --> 00:06:43.261
Umi...

00:07:00.421 --> 00:07:01.481
Presea.

00:07:04.231 --> 00:07:06.091
Master Mage Clef.

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:14.421
I will now go revive...

00:07:15.171 --> 00:07:16.831
...Hikaru's sword.

00:07:18.211 --> 00:07:24.701
It takes a very strong will to revive
a weapon forged from escudo.

00:07:24.951 --> 00:07:30.181
The hearts of the master smith and
the weapon's owner must become one...

00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:31.781
...for it to happen.

00:07:31.891 --> 00:07:37.021
No, even if it does happen,
you may both lose your lives.

00:07:39.161 --> 00:07:40.991
I am aware of that.

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:43.131
Master Mage...

00:07:43.231 --> 00:07:48.571
...I want to fulfill the duties of master
smith in place of my elder sister.

00:07:50.171 --> 00:07:54.971
If my late sister, Presea,
had really been revived...

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:58.581
...I'm sure she would
have done the same thing.

00:07:59.051 --> 00:08:01.711
I am a master smith like my sister.

00:08:01.821 --> 00:08:06.251
I cannot create weapons
for Magic Knights from escudo...

00:08:06.821 --> 00:08:09.221
...but I know the spell to revive them.

00:08:10.291 --> 00:08:11.591
Presea...

00:08:12.161 --> 00:08:13.631
Master Mage Clef.

00:08:13.731 --> 00:08:19.191
I thank you very much for welcoming
me into the castle as Presea.

00:08:20.871 --> 00:08:24.031
Even for the Pillar,
Princess Emeraude...

00:08:24.141 --> 00:08:28.171
...it was impossible
to revive a life that was lost.

00:08:28.941 --> 00:08:33.281
My sister's death was
the outcome she herself had chosen.

00:08:33.781 --> 00:08:36.881
It was definitely not Ascot's fault.

00:08:37.091 --> 00:08:40.381
However, if Presea
had not been revived...

00:08:40.491 --> 00:08:44.751
...he surely would
never have smiled again.

00:08:45.331 --> 00:08:47.891
Neither would the Magic Knights.

00:08:49.231 --> 00:08:51.661
If my sister, Presea,
had stayed deceased...

00:08:51.771 --> 00:08:55.171
...the Magic Knights would
spend their days here in Cephiro...

00:08:55.271 --> 00:08:58.211
...blaming themselves,
torturing themselves.

00:08:58.411 --> 00:09:01.341
On top of
Princess Emeraude's passing.

00:09:01.941 --> 00:09:04.711
To bear more deaths
connected to them...

00:09:04.811 --> 00:09:07.911
...is too cruel for
the hearts of those girls.

00:09:10.551 --> 00:09:12.881
When you came to this castle...

00:09:12.991 --> 00:09:16.921
...I truly thought that
Presea had returned.

00:09:17.331 --> 00:09:20.691
We really did look alike.

00:09:21.631 --> 00:09:25.401
Our eyes, hair, face...
Completely identical twins.

00:09:26.001 --> 00:09:27.761
The one difference...

00:09:28.741 --> 00:09:30.901
...was the birthmark on my chest.

00:09:31.011 --> 00:09:33.741
Presea didn't have a birthmark...

00:09:40.321 --> 00:09:43.941
Be sure to come back
after reviving the sword.

00:09:45.751 --> 00:09:46.851
I will.

00:09:50.391 --> 00:09:52.261
What is your real name?

00:09:55.701 --> 00:09:57.631
My name is Presea.

00:09:58.001 --> 00:10:00.491
Presea, master smith of Cephiro.

00:10:07.511 --> 00:10:09.441
Clef, my sister...

00:10:10.311 --> 00:10:11.611
Presea...

00:10:11.851 --> 00:10:14.041
...was in love with you.

00:10:16.851 --> 00:10:18.791
Did you say something?

00:10:19.021 --> 00:10:21.221
No, nothing.

00:10:29.731 --> 00:10:30.821
Mokona.

00:10:35.971 --> 00:10:38.061
Are you worried about me?

00:10:40.381 --> 00:10:41.501
You knew...

00:10:41.911 --> 00:10:44.881
You knew that I wasn't Presea.

00:10:49.721 --> 00:10:54.811
This is no good. Presea would
never cry at a time like this.

00:10:57.131 --> 00:10:59.061
I'm such a fool...

00:10:59.991 --> 00:11:02.591
Sure, Presea and I looked alike...

00:11:03.131 --> 00:11:06.901
...but I didn't think we would
fall in love with the same man.

00:11:10.641 --> 00:11:12.441
Thank you, Mokona...

00:11:22.451 --> 00:11:27.581
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:29.461 --> 00:11:33.591
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:48.081 --> 00:11:49.041
Fuu!

00:11:49.341 --> 00:11:50.441
Fuu!

00:11:59.391 --> 00:12:00.481
Fuu...

00:12:08.131 --> 00:12:10.061
I'll save you for sure.

00:12:23.041 --> 00:12:24.711
Lantis!

00:12:24.951 --> 00:12:27.111
Lantis, where are you?

00:12:27.581 --> 00:12:29.411
Really, where is he?

00:12:29.521 --> 00:12:31.081
Lantis!

00:12:32.051 --> 00:12:36.851
He's so big. I would think
it'd be easy to find him.

00:12:36.961 --> 00:12:38.591
Oh, pixie-lady!

00:12:40.701 --> 00:12:43.561
Hey, do you know
where Ms. Hikaru is?

00:12:43.661 --> 00:12:46.001
Hikaru? I have no clue.

00:12:46.101 --> 00:12:47.261
I see...

00:12:47.571 --> 00:12:52.271
I was able to make a wreath really
well, so I wanted to give it to her...

00:12:52.741 --> 00:12:54.001
Can it be?

00:12:54.111 --> 00:12:57.171
Could Lantis be
with Hikaru right now?

00:13:05.321 --> 00:13:06.151
Hikaru?

00:13:06.251 --> 00:13:07.411
Miss...

00:13:23.241 --> 00:13:24.331
Presea.

00:13:26.241 --> 00:13:27.731
What's wrong, Presea?

00:13:28.641 --> 00:13:30.241
Were you crying?

00:13:33.411 --> 00:13:34.851
It's nothing.

00:13:37.021 --> 00:13:38.181
Mokona!

00:13:44.491 --> 00:13:46.791
Is your heart ready for this?

00:13:49.761 --> 00:13:52.761
You're sure that you
want to revive your sword?

00:13:56.401 --> 00:13:58.901
Terrible danger might befall you.

00:13:59.471 --> 00:14:01.531
Are you fine with that?

00:14:01.641 --> 00:14:04.411
This is a battle
that I chose for myself.

00:14:04.681 --> 00:14:06.581
I decided this as well...

00:14:07.751 --> 00:14:11.711
That I want to fight together
with Rayearth once more!

00:14:12.591 --> 00:14:14.561
And with Umi and Fuu.

00:15:05.541 --> 00:15:09.411
You will now have
to fight against yourself.

00:15:10.881 --> 00:15:13.541
At all times, believe in yourself.

00:15:15.151 --> 00:15:18.741
Here in Cephiro,
your heart determines everything.

00:15:19.291 --> 00:15:22.221
Keep wishing,
no matter what happens...

00:15:22.991 --> 00:15:24.921
Hold on to your wish...

00:15:44.581 --> 00:15:45.671
That's...

00:15:46.581 --> 00:15:47.671
Umi...

00:15:48.581 --> 00:15:49.521
Fuu...

00:15:51.591 --> 00:15:52.751
That's right...

00:15:52.851 --> 00:15:54.621
The sky lit up back then...

00:15:54.721 --> 00:15:57.161
We were summoned
to another world.

00:15:57.861 --> 00:16:00.881
But if the three of us
hadn't been together...

00:16:01.001 --> 00:16:03.261
...would we have been summoned?

00:16:03.761 --> 00:16:07.791
I wonder what would've happened
if we hadn't all gathered there.

00:16:09.571 --> 00:16:11.831
We fought the best we could.

00:16:12.411 --> 00:16:16.271
We didn't know each other before
being summoned to Cephiro...

00:16:16.381 --> 00:16:21.281
But we only had each other, so we were
able to work together and do our best.

00:16:21.381 --> 00:16:24.321
We were able
to fight to return to Tokyo.

00:16:25.121 --> 00:16:28.281
But if we weren't all together...

00:16:28.961 --> 00:16:31.051
...what would have happened?

00:16:33.561 --> 00:16:35.831
Would we have died midway through?

00:16:36.201 --> 00:16:38.831
Would I have died
unable to return to Tokyo...

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:41.401
...and would I just have disappeared?

00:16:42.741 --> 00:16:45.571
Umi and Fuu are
important teammates.

00:16:45.971 --> 00:16:47.771
Because we were together...

00:16:47.881 --> 00:16:51.571
...we were able to fight to the end.
They were dear, dear teammates.

00:16:51.811 --> 00:16:52.901
But...

00:16:53.511 --> 00:16:56.781
If Umi and Fuu weren't there...

00:16:57.321 --> 00:16:58.951
...what would have happened?

00:17:06.931 --> 00:17:08.021
Nova...

00:17:16.671 --> 00:17:18.801
If those two weren't there...

00:17:18.911 --> 00:17:21.531
...you wouldn't have gone
through those hardships.

00:17:21.641 --> 00:17:22.771
That's not true!

00:17:22.881 --> 00:17:25.511
Those times really were tough, but...

00:17:25.981 --> 00:17:29.181
But I decided on
my own to go through them.

00:17:29.851 --> 00:17:31.721
It wasn't Umi's or Fuu's fault!

00:17:31.791 --> 00:17:33.551
But it was hard.

00:17:33.821 --> 00:17:35.251
And it hurt.

00:17:36.021 --> 00:17:37.121
That's...

00:17:37.861 --> 00:17:40.591
Hey, can't you think of it this way?

00:17:40.701 --> 00:17:46.101
If you hadn't come to Cephiro,
you wouldn't have had to feel this pain.

00:17:48.001 --> 00:17:50.491
If you weren't
summoned to Cephiro...

00:17:50.601 --> 00:17:53.511
...you never would have
faced these hardships.

00:17:55.181 --> 00:17:59.141
It was tough, but because
the three of us did our best together...

00:18:12.231 --> 00:18:14.021
Then what about him?

00:18:14.131 --> 00:18:17.101
You killed him, right?

00:18:21.341 --> 00:18:22.771
It was hard.

00:18:23.371 --> 00:18:25.131
It pained your heart.

00:18:27.441 --> 00:18:28.671
Zagato...

00:18:33.211 --> 00:18:36.211
You didn't want to do
something like this, right?

00:18:38.221 --> 00:18:41.921
Back then, I was pretending
to be the righteous hero...

00:18:42.591 --> 00:18:48.121
...and I didn't know why Zagato
started the battle or how he truly felt.

00:18:48.861 --> 00:18:52.631
I didn't know that it would be
such a heart-wrenching battle!

00:18:54.201 --> 00:18:55.291
That's right...

00:18:55.701 --> 00:18:57.331
You didn't know.

00:18:58.671 --> 00:19:01.371
But you killed him.

00:19:08.221 --> 00:19:09.911
Princess Emeraude!

00:19:10.521 --> 00:19:11.611
That's right.

00:19:12.121 --> 00:19:15.851
You killed her too, Hikaru.

00:19:16.121 --> 00:19:17.991
All three of you together.

00:19:18.331 --> 00:19:20.521
Princess Emeraude...

00:19:21.831 --> 00:19:23.591
It pained your heart.

00:19:26.971 --> 00:19:28.331
It was sad.

00:19:47.221 --> 00:19:48.981
This can't be true!

00:19:51.861 --> 00:19:53.351
This can't...

00:19:53.791 --> 00:19:56.761
...be true!

00:20:02.071 --> 00:20:03.541
It was hard.

00:20:03.941 --> 00:20:08.311
Dragged into a battle you were
no part of, your heart was wounded.

00:20:08.911 --> 00:20:11.841
The Pillar of Cephiro is
the one who got you involved.

00:20:11.951 --> 00:20:13.501
Poor Hikaru.

00:20:13.811 --> 00:20:16.721
Hikaru, who had her
kind heart wounded.

00:20:17.521 --> 00:20:21.321
It was the Pillar of Cephiro
who made you go through all this!

00:20:22.021 --> 00:20:26.081
You faced hardships because
Princess Emeraude summoned you!

00:20:26.661 --> 00:20:30.821
Right, Hikaru? You don't have to protect
a country full of people like that.

00:20:30.931 --> 00:20:32.631
Princess Emeraude...

00:20:33.431 --> 00:20:34.631
Cephiro...

00:20:35.441 --> 00:20:36.771
Come on, Hikaru.

00:20:36.871 --> 00:20:40.471
Let's forget all about
Cephiro and play together.

00:20:40.841 --> 00:20:44.001
Let's forget everything and
have fun playing together.

00:20:44.351 --> 00:20:46.371
Hikaru, I love you.

00:20:46.481 --> 00:20:49.211
If you stay, I don't need anyone else.

00:20:49.551 --> 00:20:50.851
Come here.

00:20:52.051 --> 00:20:54.821
Hikaru, come...

00:20:58.291 --> 00:20:59.451
Umi...

00:21:01.801 --> 00:21:02.921
Fuu...

00:21:12.141 --> 00:21:13.111
Come.

00:21:13.511 --> 00:21:14.671
Come...

00:21:15.681 --> 00:21:17.141
...over here.

00:21:43.671 --> 00:21:45.161
Don't, Hikaru!

00:21:45.911 --> 00:21:47.671
You shouldn't go that way!

00:21:58.221 --> 00:21:59.241
Hikaru...

00:22:17.911 --> 00:22:23.311
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.981 --> 00:22:31.251
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.691 --> 00:22:38.251
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.961 --> 00:22:42.761
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.131 --> 00:22:45.501
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.331 --> 00:22:50.631
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.011 --> 00:22:54.341
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.781 --> 00:23:01.681
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.121 --> 00:23:05.521
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.851 --> 00:23:14.281
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.131 --> 00:23:20.461
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.701 --> 00:23:28.771
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.841 --> 00:23:37.651
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.191 --> 00:23:47.961
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.701 --> 00:23:50.531
The darkness within my heart.

00:23:50.631 --> 00:23:53.431
Memories appear one
by one in front of my eyes.

00:23:53.601 --> 00:23:57.561
The Umi and Fuu in my
memories blame me. Why?

00:23:58.071 --> 00:24:02.671
We promised we'd fight together...
That we'd never drift apart!

00:24:03.411 --> 00:24:05.501
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.611 --> 00:24:08.411
Hikaru and Friendships Torn Apart.

00:24:08.821 --> 00:24:09.381
You have to watch it!

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:10.981
Hikaru and Friendships Torn Apart
You have to watch it!

00:24:10.981 --> 00:24:13.391
Hikaru and Friendships Torn Apart

00:24:13.391 --> 00:24:20.321
Who is it today?

00:24:21.431 --> 00:24:23.291
Today, it's Primera!

00:24:23.401 --> 00:24:23.761
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.761 --> 00:24:26.601
Look forward to the next episode!
You have to watch the next episode!

00:24:26.601 --> 00:24:29.361
Look forward to the next episode!
